{
    "title": "Rubik's Cube Solver: 3\u00d73 Cube",
    "description": "Rubik\u2019s Cube Solver - Solve Cube Puzzle\r\n\r\n\r\nUnlock the secrets of the Rubik's Cube with Cube Solver! Our app offers a powerful and intuitive way to solve 3x3 cube and also you can play from the classic 2x2 to the challenging 15x15 rubix cube  with our realistic 3D model. Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned cuber, Cube Solver has something for everyone.\r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde9 Manual Input: Easily input colors using our intuitive color picker for precise solving.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf7 Scan Cube (Camera Input): Use your camera to scan and capture the cube's color state for quick and accurate solving.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Play 3D Cube: Experience play and solve cubes from 2x2 to 15x15 with our realistic 3D model.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u23f1\ufe0f Cube Solution Timer: Track your solving speed and improve your times with our built-in timer.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f Realistic 3D Graphics and Animation: Enjoy stunning visuals and smooth animations for a truly immersive experience.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Simple and Handy Controls: Navigate and manipulate the cube effortlessly with user-friendly controls.\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Free Cube Rotation in All Axes: Rotate the cube freely to inspect and solve from any angle.\r\n\r\n\r\nAdditional Features:\r\n\r\n\r\n- Virtual Cube: Solve a realistic 3D model of the cube for enhanced learning and practice.\r\n- Zoom/Pan: Zoom in and pan the cube for a closer look at specific sections.\r\n- Reorient to Initial State: Easily reset the cube to its initial state for repeated practice.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer:\r\nAll product names, logos, brands, trademarks, and registered trademarks are the property of their respective owners. Use of these names, trademarks, and brands does not imply endorsement. Cube Solver is independently owned and operated, and is not affiliated with any other apps or companies.\r\n\r\n\r\nSolve the World's Best-Selling Puzzle:\r\nDiscover the most effective way to solve the Rubik's Cube with Cube Solver. Whether you scan your cube using the camera or input the colors manually, our app provides the fastest and easiest solutions. Dive into the fascinating world of cube puzzles and sharpen your problem-solving skills with Cube Solver!\r\n\r\nDownload Rubiks Cube Solver now and become a cube solving master today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Rubik\u2019s Cube Solver - Solve Cube Puzzle<br><br><br>Unlock the secrets of the Rubik&#39;s Cube with Cube Solver! Our app offers a powerful and intuitive way to solve 3x3 cube and also you can play from the classic 2x2 to the challenging 15x15 rubix cube  with our realistic 3D model. Whether you&#39;re a beginner or a seasoned cuber, Cube Solver has something for everyone.<br><br><br>Key Features:<br><br><br>\ud83e\udde9 Manual Input: Easily input colors using our intuitive color picker for precise solving.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udcf7 Scan Cube (Camera Input): Use your camera to scan and capture the cube&#39;s color state for quick and accurate solving.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udfae Play 3D Cube: Experience play and solve cubes from 2x2 to 15x15 with our realistic 3D model.<br><br><br>\u23f1\ufe0f Cube Solution Timer: Track your solving speed and improve your times with our built-in timer.<br><br><br>\ud83c\udf1f Realistic 3D Graphics and Animation: Enjoy stunning visuals and smooth animations for a truly immersive experience.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Simple and Handy Controls: Navigate and manipulate the cube effortlessly with user-friendly controls.<br><br><br>\ud83d\udd04 Free Cube Rotation in All Axes: Rotate the cube freely to inspect and solve from any angle.<br><br><br>Additional Features:<br><br><br>- Virtual Cube: Solve a realistic 3D model of the cube for enhanced learning and practice.<br>- Zoom/Pan: Zoom in and pan the cube for a closer look at specific sections.<br>- Reorient to Initial State: Easily reset the cube to its initial state for repeated practice.<br><br><br><br><br>Disclaimer:<br>All product names, logos, brands, trademarks, and registered trademarks are the property of their respective owners. Use of these names, trademarks, and brands does not imply endorsement. Cube Solver is independently owned and operated, and is not affiliated with any other apps or companies.<br><br><br>Solve the World&#39;s Best-Selling Puzzle:<br>Discover the most effective way to solve the Rubik&#39;s Cube with Cube Solver. Whether you scan your cube using the camera or input the colors manually, our app provides the fastest and easiest solutions. Dive into the fascinating world of cube puzzles and sharpen your problem-solving skills with Cube Solver!<br><br>Download Rubiks Cube Solver now and become a cube solving master today!",
